NimbyGreet (Greet) - original work by Jeff Fabish for NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp.
Will modify the vanilla DayZ 1.30 MissionServer, MissionBase, MissionGameplay, PlayerBase, and
InGameMenu classes (Bohemia Interactive) to fetch and show the server welcome text; no
third-party mod code. Media shipped under Media/ is listed here with its source and license at
each release (plan G15).

Media (Phase 0 probe only; removed before the release gate, plan G15):

- Media/probe.mp4: generated October 26, 2026 with ffmpeg (lavfi color source plus drawtext,
  DejaVu Sans), a dark 320x180 frame with the text NIMBY sliding across for 3 s, looped, silent,
  H.264 yuv420p, 7 KB. No third-party content; no license applies beyond this repository's.
- Media/probe-base.mp4, probe-base-aac.mp4, probe-high-aac.mp4, probe-mpeg4.mp4: the same clip
  re-encoded for the run 2 decode probe (H.264 Constrained Baseline without and with a silent AAC
  track, H.264 High with AAC, MPEG-4 Part 2 Simple Profile). Same source, same terms.
- Media/probe.png, Media/probe.edds: generated the same way, a 512x256 still of the text NIMBY
  (ImageToPAA refuses a 320x180 source: "Img is not of power of 2 size"), converted with DayZ
  Tools ImageToPAA. Same terms.

